    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The tiered scarcity idea sounds good. But I'm looking at the warehouse numbers and we actually just got a massive shipment of the Vanguard Chrono in—we have plenty of stock. If I put a \"limited stock\" timer on the site, isn't that going to look fake if people realize we have tons of them? Or should we just run the timer anyway to drive those conversions?",
